  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contract related to: EU Contribution to the Umbrella Facility for Poverty and Equity Multi-Donor Trust Fund (Trust Fund No. 073670) - The Support Measures and Cooperation Facility for Asia and the Pacific 2022, 2023 and 2024 provides the European Commission the possibility to finance small-scale activities that are needed for the achievement of the objectives of the Neighbourhood, Development and International Cooperation Instrument (NDICI-Global Europe) in those regions.</narrative>
